        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Figured silk ribbon, possibly for a parasol covering. Divided into three stripes of unequal width. The widest has a pattern of wheat ears and oats in yellow. The vary narrow one has a wavy leafy stem in white and green. Reversible."@en ;
